<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{!allowed}}" class="scope-note">开发者模式已关闭。请在「我的」点击 5 次「关于记一下喵」重新开启。</view>
  <block wx:else>
  <view class="sections">
    <view class="section {{section === 'start' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-section="start" bindtap="onSection">首次使用</view>
    <view class="section {{section === 'core' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-section="core" bindtap="onSection">核心自检</view>
    <view class="section {{section === 'flow' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-section="flow" bindtap="onSection">聊天流程</view>
    <view class="section {{section === 'logs' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-section="logs" bindtap="onSection">执行日志</view>
  </view>
  <block wx:if="{{section === 'start'}}">
    <view class="scope-note">从欢迎页检查模型选择，或在独立测试家庭体验首次建档与记录。原家庭与正式模型配置保留。</view>
    <view class="space-note {{activeTest ? 'is-test' : ''}}">
      <view class="space-label">{{activeTest ? '当前处于测试家庭' : '当前家庭'}}</view>
      <view>{{currentFamilyName || '正在读取…'}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{canReturn}}" class="space-sub">可返回：{{originalFamilyName}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="jd-card tool-card">
      <view class="tool-title">重走开始使用</view>
      <view class="tool-desc">依次体验欢迎页、微信云开发 AI 或自定义 API 的选择。演练不会覆盖正式配置。</view>
      <view class="tool-action"><t-button theme="primary" block shape="round" disabled="{{firstUseBusy}}" bind:tap="onReplay">从欢迎页开始</t-button></view>
    </view>
    <view class="jd-card tool-card">
      <view class="tool-title">进入空白测试家庭</view>
      <view class="tool-desc">体验添加第一只宠物、空状态和第一条日记。保存内容属于测试家庭，原家庭数据保留。</view>
      <view class="tool-action"><t-button theme="primary" variant="outline" block shape="round" loading="{{firstUseBusy}}" disabled="{{firstUseBusy}}" bind:tap="onEnterEmpty">进入空白测试家庭</t-button></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{canReturn}}" class="jd-card tool-card">
      <view class="tool-title">返回原家庭</view>
      <view class="tool-desc">回到「{{originalFamilyName}}」。测试家庭与数据会保留。</view>
      <view class="tool-action"><t-button theme="primary" block shape="round" disabled="{{firstUseBusy}}" bind:tap="onReturn">返回原家庭</t-button></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{firstUseError}}" class="scope-note">{{firstUseError}}</view>
    <view class="foot-note">仍为空的测试家庭会复用，已有宠物时另建。每个账号最多加入 10 个家庭，不自动删除测试数据。</view>
    <view class="family-link" bindtap="goFamily">查看账号与家庭空间</view>
  </block>
  <block wx:if="{{section === 'core'}}">
  <view class="scope-note">仅使用内存演示数据检查核心逻辑，不读写本机缓存，也不请求云端或模型。相同用例同时在自动化测试中运行。</view>
  <view class="lastrun">固定演示参考日期：{{referenceDate}}。通过不代表云端权限、真实模型或真机流程已验收。</view>
  <view class="summary">
    <view class="sum-item">
      <text class="sum-num is-pass">{{passed}}</text>
      <text class="sum-label">通过</text>
    </view>
    <view class="sum-item">
      <text class="sum-num is-fail">{{failed}}</text>
      <text class="sum-label">失败</text>
    </view>
    <t-button theme="primary" size="small" shape="round" loading="{{running}}" disabled="{{running}}" bind:tap="onRerun">重新运行</t-button>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{lastRunAt}}" class="lastrun">上次运行：{{lastRunAt}}（共 {{results.length}} 项）</view>
  <view wx:if="{{running}}" class="lastrun">运行中…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!results.length && !running}}" class="lastrun">暂无结果</view>

  <view wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="id" class="case {{item.pass ? 'is-pass' : 'is-fail'}}">
    <view class="case-head">
      <t-icon name="{{item.pass ? 'check-circle-filled' : 'close-circle-filled'}}" size="32rpx" color="{{item.pass ? '#2F6B4F' : '#D54941'}}" />
      <text class="case-name">{{item.name}}</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.detail}}" class="case-detail">{{item.detail}}</view>
  </view>
  </block>
  <block wx:if="{{section === 'flow'}}">
    <view class="scope-note">在独立测试家庭创建专用宠物，之后在聊聊逐步执行或运行全部。每步会调用已配置的模型，并自动确认日期正确的演示草稿；模型调用可能计费。不会随打开页面自动运行。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{flowError}}" class="case-detail">{{flowError}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{flow}}" class="case">
      <view class="case-name">{{flow.status}} · 已完成 {{flow.next}} / {{flowSteps.length}}</view>
      <view class="case-detail">运行 {{flow.id}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{flow.error}}" class="case-detail">{{flow.error}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="log-actions">
      <t-button wx:if="{{!flow || flow.status === 'prepare_failed' || flow.status === 'preparing'}}" theme="primary" size="small" loading="{{flowBusy}}" disabled="{{flowBusy}}" bind:tap="onPrepareFlow">{{flow ? '继续准备' : '准备测试家庭'}}</t-button>
      <t-button wx:if="{{flow.petId}}" theme="primary" size="small" disabled="{{flowBusy}}" bind:tap="onOpenFlow">打开测试聊天</t-button>
      <t-button wx:if="{{flow}}" size="small" disabled="{{flowBusy}}" bind:tap="onCleanupFlow">清理本轮测试</t-button>
      <t-button size="small" disabled="{{flowBusy}}" bind:tap="onReturnFamily">返回原家庭</t-button>
    </view>
    <view wx:for="{{flow.results}}" wx:key="id" class="case {{item.pass ? 'is-pass' : 'is-fail'}}">
      <view class="case-name">{{item.pass ? '通过' : '停止'}} · {{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="case-detail">{{item.detail}}</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!flow}}" class="scope-note">
      <view wx:for="{{flowSteps}}" wx:key="id">{{index + 1}}. {{item.title}}</view>
    </view>
  </block>
  <block wx:if="{{section === 'logs'}}">
    <view class="scope-note">开启后记录当前家庭的聊天执行过程。仅在本机保留最近 12 次请求，每次最多 48 条事件，不采集密钥、聊天正文或照片。</view>
    <view class="trace-toolbar">
      <t-button size="small" theme="primary" bind:tap="onToggleTrace">{{tracing ? '停止记录' : '开始记录'}}</t-button>
      <view class="trace-toolbar-actions">
        <t-button size="small" variant="text" bind:tap="onCopyLogs">复制全部日志</t-button>
        <view class="trace-icon-action" bindtap="onRefreshLogs" aria-role="button" aria-label="刷新日志"><t-icon name="refresh" size="36rpx" color="#32694F" /></view>
        <view class="trace-icon-action" bindtap="onLogMore" aria-role="button" aria-label="更多日志操作"><t-icon name="ellipsis" size="36rpx" color="#78837B" /></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!traceRows.length}}" class="scope-note">暂无日志。开启记录后去「聊聊」发送消息，再回到这里查看。</view>
    <view wx:for="{{traceRows}}" wx:key="id" class="case">
      <view class="trace-head">
        <view class="trace-heading">
          <view class="case-name">{{item.status}} · {{item.durationMs}}ms</view>
          <view class="case-detail">请求 {{item.id}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="trace-icon-action" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onCopyTraceLogs" aria-role="button" aria-label="复制本条日志"><t-icon name="copy" size="36rpx" color="#32694F" /></view>
      </view>
      <text class="trace-detail" selectable>{{item.detail}}</text>
    </view>
  </block>
  </block>
</view>
